{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddAPaywall"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux"]]},"kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Wire the "},{"code":"SwiduxPaywall","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" plugin into a Swidux app to gate features behind a subscription or lifetime purchase."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swidux\/howtoaddapaywall"]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Related-Documentation","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PluginPaywallReference","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PluginArchitecture"],"title":"Related Documentation"},{"generated":true,"anchor":"How-to-Guides","title":"How-to Guides","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddAVersionKillswitch","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddAParentalGate","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddAnalytics","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddFeatureFlags","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddPersistence","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddICloudSync","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/BuildingADomainPlugin","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/AgentSkill"]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Swidux"}],"roleHeading":"Article","title":"Add a Paywall","role":"article"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This guide takes you from a wired Swidux app to a fully gated feature with paywall presentation, entitlement observation, restore, and manage-subscription support. It covers state and action wiring, implementing a ","type":"text"},{"code":"PaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", presenting the sheet, gating a feature, and previewing in pro state."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For an API-level reference of every type and action, see "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PluginPaywallReference"},{"text":". For where domain plugins fit in the dispatch cycle, see ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PluginArchitecture"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Before-you-start","text":"Before you start"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This guide assumes:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You have a Swidux app already wired up — ","type":"text"},{"code":"AppState","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"AppAction","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppReducer"},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppStore"},{"type":"text","text":" exist and the store is in the SwiftUI environment. If you’re not there yet, follow "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/GettingStarted","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" first."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You have a purchase backend in mind. RevenueCat is the path of least resistance, but vanilla StoreKit or a custom server work just as well — the plugin doesn’t care."}]}]}]},{"text":"Step 1: Add the dependency","anchor":"Step-1-Add-the-dependency","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxPaywall"},{"type":"text","text":" product to your app target in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Package.swift"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"code":[".target(","    name: \"MyApp\",","    dependencies: [","        \"Swidux\",","        \"SwiduxPaywall\",","    ]",")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Step-2-Add-state-and-actions","text":"Step 2: Add state and actions"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add a paywall slice to "},{"code":"AppState","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with "},{"code":"@Slice","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and a paywall case to "},{"code":"AppAction","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ AppState.swift","import SwiduxPaywall","","@Swidux","nonisolated struct AppState: Equatable, Sendable {","    @Slice var paywall: PaywallState = .init()","    \/\/ … other slices","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ AppAction.swift","import SwiduxPaywall","","enum AppAction: Sendable {","    case paywall(PaywallAction)","    \/\/ … other cases","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"aside","name":"Tip","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"code":"import SwiduxPaywall","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is needed in "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"every","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" file that touches "},{"code":"store.paywall.*","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"code":"PaywallAction","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — including views that read the slice for display. "},{"code":"@_exported import Swidux","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" re-exports core Swidux only, not plugin modules. See "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PluginArchitecture","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"style":"tip"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The plugin owns reducing for ","type":"text"},{"code":".paywall","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" actions, so the root reducer should fall through:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ AppReducer.swift","case .paywall:","    return nil"],"syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"Step-3-Provide-a-PaywallService","text":"Step 3: Provide a `PaywallService`","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The plugin needs a "},{"code":"PaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" conformer that talks to your purchase backend. Pick the path that matches your backend."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Path-A-RevenueCat-recommended","text":"Path A: RevenueCat (recommended)"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" companion package and use the supplied ","type":"text"},{"code":"RevenueCatPaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". No bridging code on your side.","type":"text"}]},{"code":[".package(url: \"https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\", from: \"1.0.0\"),"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"code":["import SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","","let service = RevenueCatPaywallService()"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The companion package also ships ","type":"text"},{"code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", a SwiftUI sheet built on RevenueCatUI that hands purchase results back through the plugin. See its "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/heirloomlogic.github.io\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/"},{"type":"text","text":" for configuration (API key, entitlement identifiers)."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Path-B-StoreKit-or-custom-backend","level":3,"text":"Path B: StoreKit or custom backend"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For any non-RevenueCat backend, implement "},{"code":"PaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" directly. The protocol is small:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import SwiduxPaywall","","struct MyPaywallService: PaywallService {","    func customerInfo() async throws -> EntitlementSnapshot {","        \/\/ Fetch the current entitlement once.","        return EntitlementSnapshot()","    }","","    func customerInfoStream() -> AsyncStream<EntitlementSnapshot> {","        AsyncStream { continuation in","            \/\/ Yield a new snapshot each time the entitlement changes.","            \/\/ Call continuation.finish() when the source ends.","        }","    }","","    func restorePurchases() async throws -> EntitlementSnapshot {","        \/\/ Run a restore against the user's account and return the result.","        return EntitlementSnapshot()","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A vanilla StoreKit conformer iterates "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Transaction.currentEntitlements"},{"type":"text","text":" and listens to "},{"code":"Transaction.updates","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"; a custom server conformer hits whatever endpoint reports the user’s entitlement.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Previews and tests","anchor":"Previews-and-tests"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the built-in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MockPaywallService"},{"type":"text","text":" for backend-agnostic previews:"}]},{"code":["let service = MockPaywallService(isPro: true)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you’re on Path A, "},{"code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" also ships "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MockRevenueCatPaywallService"},{"type":"text","text":" for RevenueCat-flavored previews."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Step-4-Wire-the-plugin","text":"Step 4: Wire the plugin"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Construct and register "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PaywallPlugin"},{"type":"text","text":" inside your "},{"code":"Store.configured()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" factory:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import SwiduxPaywall","","let paywallPlugin = PaywallPlugin<AppState, AppAction>(","    state: \\.paywall,","    action: AppAction.paywall,","    extractAction: { if case .paywall(let a) = $0 { return a }; return nil },","    service: RevenueCatPaywallService()",")","plugins.register(paywallPlugin)"],"type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"Step-5-Observe-customer-info-on-launch","text":"Step 5: Observe customer info on launch","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Start the long-lived entitlement stream once, on the root view:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["struct ContentView: View {","    @Environment(AppStore.self) private var store","","    var body: some View {","        RootContent()","            .task { store.send(.paywall(.observeCustomerInfo)) }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"observeCustomerInfo","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" returns an effect that lives for the duration of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PaywallService.customerInfoStream()"},{"type":"text","text":". Every snapshot the service yields flows through "},{"code":".customerInfoUpdated","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and updates ","type":"text"},{"code":"store.paywall.isPro","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"code":"hasPermanentLicense","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Step 6: Present the paywall","level":2,"anchor":"Step-6-Present-the-paywall","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Bind a sheet to "},{"code":"store.paywall.isPresented","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and dispatch ","type":"text"},{"code":".paywall(.dismiss)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" when it closes:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":[".sheet(isPresented: Binding(","    get: { store.paywall.isPresented },","    set: { if !$0 { store.send(.paywall(.dismiss)) } }",")) {","    PaywallSheet()","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Trigger presentation by dispatching "},{"code":".paywall(.request(reason:))","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with a short identifier describing why you’re asking. The reason is stored in "},{"code":"store.paywall.requestedReason","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" so the sheet can tailor its copy."}]},{"code":["store.send(.paywall(.request(reason: \"export-pdf\")))"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Step-7-Gate-a-feature","level":2,"text":"Step 7: Gate a feature"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Read ","type":"text"},{"code":"PaywallState.isGateSatisfied","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" before running gated work. If it’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", dispatch "},{"code":".request","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" instead:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["Button(\"Export PDF\") {","    if store.paywall.isGateSatisfied {","        store.send(.export(.exportPDF))","    } else {","        store.send(.paywall(.request(reason: \"export-pdf\")))","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"Step-8-Restore-purchases","level":2,"text":"Step 8: Restore purchases","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add a restore button to your paywall sheet. Reflect "},{"code":"store.paywall.isLoading","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to disable it while the call is in flight:"}]},{"code":["Button(\"Restore Purchases\") {","    store.send(.paywall(.restorePurchases))","}",".disabled(store.paywall.isLoading)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On success, the resulting snapshot flows through "},{"code":".customerInfoUpdated","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and updates the gate. On failure, "},{"code":"store.paywall.error","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is set."}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Step-9-Manage-subscriptions","type":"heading","text":"Step 9: Manage subscriptions"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For an existing subscriber, surface a button that deep-links into the system subscription management page:"}]},{"code":["Button(\"Manage Subscription\") {","    store.send(.paywall(.openManageSubscriptions))","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This opens "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"itms-apps:\/\/apps.apple.com\/account\/subscriptions"},{"text":" via the plugin’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"openURL","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" handler, which routes to the App Store on iOS and Settings on macOS."}]},{"anchor":"Testing","level":2,"text":"Testing","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use "},{"code":"MockPaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to drive previews and tests into a known entitlement state:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["#Preview(\"Pro\") {","    let store = AppStore.configured(","        paywallService: MockPaywallService(isPro: true)","    )","    return ContentView().environment(store)","}","","#Preview(\"Free\") {","    let store = AppStore.configured(","        paywallService: MockPaywallService()","    )","    return ContentView().environment(store)","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Plumb the service through a parameter on your ","type":"text"},{"code":"Store.configured()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" factory so previews can override it without touching the live RevenueCat SDK.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/PluginPaywallReference":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PluginPaywallReference","type":"topic","kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"API reference for the ","type":"text"},{"code":"SwiduxPaywall","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" library — paywall presentation, entitlement observation, and purchase orchestration.","type":"text"}],"role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/pluginpaywallreference","title":"SwiduxPaywall Reference"},"https://heirloomlogic.github.io/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall/":{"type":"link","url":"https:\/\/heirloomlogic.github.io\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"DocC reference"}],"identifier":"https:\/\/heirloomlogic.github.io\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/","title":"DocC reference"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/HowToAddAnalytics":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddAnalytics","type":"topic","kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Wire the "},{"code":"SwiduxAnalytics","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" plugin into a Swidux app for centralized event tracking with declarative event mapping and auto-identify."}],"role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/howtoaddanalytics","title":"Add Analytics"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux":{"url":"\/documentation\/swidux","abstract":[{"text":"Redux-style state management for SwiftUI, with macros for observability and ready-made plugins for persistence, undo, paywalls, version killswitches, and parental gates.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","title":"Swidux"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/HowToAddFeatureFlags":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddFeatureFlags","type":"topic","kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Wire the ","type":"text"},{"code":"SwiduxFeatureFlags","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" plugin into a Swidux app for typed feature flags, A\/B variants, and remote-tunable scalar values from a single JSON con